Let korrid resize the encoder of one running stream (korri#476, Route C).
The certificate-control socket of patch 0020 takes a "resize" request. Sunshine
finds the running session whose client certificate has the request's
fingerprint and gives patch 0044's resolution request to that session's
channel. The answer goes back to korrid, never to the stream's client.

